  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1190098/description_d650851d-029c-4260-80a9-5198899bec33.png\"></p><p>MoreContentRPG - 怪物與傳奇將典型的《我的世界》轉變為角色扮演風格遊戲。在法師、戰士、弓箭手等職業中選擇你的道路。探索世界與地下城。打造你的世界。擊敗強大的頭目，並完成各種任務與挑戰。</p><p>日常怪物會變得越來越強，所以裝備起來，擊敗所有敵人。</p><p>精簡版本：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/morecontentrpg-beasts-heros-lite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreContentRPG - 野獸與英雄</a></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f9cae91d-c7a7-487c-b8ef-031800e58368.png\" width=\"524\" height=\"262\"></p><p>🌎&nbsp; <strong>美麗的新世界生成</strong> (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">噢，我們去過的生物群系</a>)</p><p>📋&nbsp;<strong>100多個任務</strong>，通過增加目標與挑戰為你的遊戲玩法增添多樣性</p><p>⚙️<strong> 優化</strong></p><p>🛕<strong>改進的</strong>要塞、地獄要塞與村莊</p><p>🗺️<strong>小地圖</strong> (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero的小地圖</a>)</p><p>✔️ <strong>實用功能</strong>，如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">背包</a>與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">傳送石碑</a></p><p>🏰 <strong>大量新的</strong>地下城與結構 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">當地下城崛起</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/towns-and-towers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">城鎮與高塔</a>)</p><p>✨ <strong>更好的</strong>視覺效果 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/subtle-effects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">細微效果</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serious-player-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">嚴肅玩家動畫</a>)</p><p>🧟‍♂️ <strong>許多新的</strong>頭目與生物 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex的生物</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mowzies-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mowzie的生物</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-conjurer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">召喚師</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰與火：龍</a>)</p><p>⚔️<strong> 改進的</strong>戰鬥與翻滾</p><p>🌌 <strong>新的</strong>維度 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮光森林</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">以太</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更深與更暗</a>)</p><p>🗡️ <strong>新的</strong>武器與盔甲 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">史詩騎士</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mariums-soulslike-weaponry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Marium的類魂武器</a>)</p><p>🧙‍♂️&nbsp;<strong>魔法與咒語</strong></p><p>🎣 <strong>新的</strong>愛好 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquaculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">水產養殖2</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-archeology\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的考古學</a>)</p><p>✅ <strong>250多個模組</strong></p><p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1190098/description_95b3c566-07b0-47d9-8fe3-8114bd5cf338.png\" width=\"630\" height=\"445\"></strong></p><p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1190098/description_dc1d2d7b-96f5-43c2-97a2-607db654e546.png\" width=\"626\" height=\"442\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1190098/description_d6f9de5a-a280-4e92-b1cb-c863a3711dcd.png\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>為MoreContentRPG分配6-12GB記憶體</strong></h1><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1190098/description_14cea595-30ec-4f42-9893-ade60c53d774.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1190098/description_46a80a35-f463-4943-a42f-c47fa1696e4b.png\"></p>",
